{"id":"twisted-warden","slug":"twisted-warden","name":"扭曲监守者","english":"Twisted Warden","kind":"enemy","categoryKey":"enemies","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/database/renders-thumb-twisted-warden.png","description":"","parameters":[["基础生命","1,750"],["基础伤害","32"],["韧性","800"],["灵魂","200"],["最高单次伤害","32"],["速度","550"]],"tables":[{"title":"Where you fight it","columns":["WHEN","QUEST","WHERE"],"rows":[["Story quest","探索深暗之域","深暗之域"],["Rematch","复活的扭曲监守者","深暗之域"]]},{"title":"Moves","columns":["移动","效果","基础伤害","类型"],"rows":[["Unburrow","The fight opens with it climbing out of the ground、and for roughly the first three 秒onds of that animation it can't be targeted or damaged. Get into position、hold your cooldowns until it's fully out.","",""],["Initial swipe","Every melee combo opens with this wide arm swing、which has only light knockback. It always rolls into a 秒ond swing、so don't stay in front of it after the first hit.","18",""],["Follow swipe","One of the two possible 秒ond swings. It does the same damage as the opener with six times the knockback、so a hit sends you flying.","18",""],["Heavy swipe","The other possible finisher、its hardest melee hit、with the same heavy knockback as the follow swipe.","22",""],["Spin attack","Unlocked at 70% health、used whenever its 20-second cooldown is up、often straight after a swipe combo. For six 秒onds it chases its target、battering everything nearby through walls、deflecting every projectile、so hold your shots、keep clear until it stops、then punish the wind-down.","3",""],["Sonic boom","After a windup of about a 秒ond、a half it fires a fast blast straight along its facing that knocks you back、leaves a line of soul puddles for 6 秒onds、each inflicting Soulsick. Sidestep out of the line instead of backing down it、and don't hug it either、because the blast also shoves away anyone close.","32","灵魂"],["Secondary sonic boom","Three more booms follow the first、0.3 秒onds apart、and it turns back toward its target as they start. Keep moving sideways until the third has passed.","18","灵魂"],["灵魂 stars","Six slow soul orbs fan out as the sonic boom fires、begin homing in after a brief delay. They burst on terrain、so ducking behind cover gets rid of them.","6","灵魂"],["灵魂 puke","Used at most once every 15 秒onds、and only when you're close enough. After a short charge-up it spews souls: anyone near its mouth is hit、knocked back、减速、and all 19 floor patches in the arena turn into Soulsick pools for 10 秒onds、so learn the patch layout、step off them before the charge ends.","15","灵魂"],["Summon","From 90% health down it roars in two or three Skeletons、up to one Flame Construct、two to six Excavators、never more than eight at once、on a 15-second cooldown. Every summoned mob yields 20 souls more than usual (24 for an Excavator or Flame Construct、28 for the Skeletons)、so the adds double as a soul refill.","",""],["Stagger","Breaking its 800 poise stuns it for 8.8 秒onds. As it gets back up it drops a Soulsick puddle just in front of itself that lasts 7 秒onds、so don't linger at its feet as the stun ends.","","灵魂"]]},{"title":"弱点与抗性","columns":["属性","变化"],"rows":[["灵魂伤害","-50%"],["近战伤害","-20%"]]},{"title":"原生属性（定义值）","native":true,"note":"解包表中的直接定义值；继承、难度与战力缩放另行计算。","columns":["定义","参数","数值"],"rows":[["扭曲监守者","生命","1750"],["扭曲监守者","视觉感知半径","3000"],["扭曲监守者","移动速度","550"],["扭曲监守者","韧性","800"],["扭曲监守者","韧性恢复延迟","10"],["扭曲监守者","韧性恢复速度","5"],["扭曲监守者","远程攻击速度","1"],["扭曲监守者","击退抗性倍率","0"],["扭曲监守者","灵魂伤害抗性倍率","0.5"],["扭曲监守者","近战伤害抗性倍率","0.8"],["扭曲监守者","理想目标距离","0"],["扭曲监守者","目标距离容差","300"],["扭曲监守者","目标距离修正","100"]]},{"title":"原生能力参数","native":true,"note":"保留能力的定义值与覆盖操作；未翻译的内部字段保留原名。","columns":["定义","能力","参数","数值","操作"],"rows":[["扭曲监守者","InitialSwipeHit","最大目标距离","0","定义值"],["扭曲监守者","InitialSwipeHit","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["扭曲监守者","InitialSwipeHit","触发权重","100","定义值"],["扭曲监守者","InitialSwipeHit","冷却时间","2","定义值"],["扭曲监守者","InitialSwipeHit","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["扭曲监守者","FollowSwipeHit","最大目标距离","0","定义值"],["扭曲监守者","FollowSwipeHit